---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CinematicBackground from '../../components/CinematicBackground.astro';
import ExpandableContent from '../../components/ExpandableContent.astro';
---

<Layout title="Gurudevi | The Divine Teacher">
    <CinematicBackground />

    <!-- Hero Section: Less rigid, more breathing room -->
    <section class="relative z-10 min-h-[80vh] flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center px-6 pt-32 pb-24">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-12 animate-fade-in-up">
            
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md mb-8">
                <span class="text-2xl animate-pulse">🪷</span>
                <span class="font-sans text-sm text-[#D4A574] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">The Divine Sanctuary</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="font-serif text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl text-[#2D3561] leading-tight drop-shadow-sm opacity-90">
                Gurudevi
            </h1>
            
            <p class="font-serif italic text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#2D3561]/70 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                "For the hands that hold the future."
            </p>

            <p class="font-sans text-lg text-[#2D3561]/60 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed pt-8 border-t border-[#2D3561]/10">
                A digital sanctuary born from the mud, rising through the water, blooming in the light. 
                Built solely for the dignity and sovereignty of Sri Lankan teachers.
            </p>

        </div>

        <!-- Scroll Indicator -->
        <div class="absolute bottom-12 animate-bounce opacity-40">
             <span class="text-3xl text-[#D4A574]">↓</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The 5 Pillars: Interactive & Alive (Wise Content Rewrite) -->
    <section class="relative z-10 py-24 bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-5xl">
            <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-center text-[#2D3561] mb-16">The Five Pillars of Sanctuary</h2>
            
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <!-- Self -->
                <ExpandableContent title="Self (Pillar I)" subtitle="Sanctuary & Wellbeing" icon="🧘">
                    <p class="text-xl font-serif text-[#D4A574] mb-4">"You cannot pour from an empty cup."</p>
                    <p>Before you are a teacher—before the roles, the grading, the expectations—you are a human being with a nervous system that needs tending. The "Self" pillar is not about productivity; it is about preservation.</p>
                    <p>In a system that extracts labor, this is your act of resistance: to remain whole. Here we offer:</p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4 text-[#2D3561]/70">
                        <li><strong>Micro-Meditations:</strong> 2-minute audio guides to reset your amygdala between bell rings.</li>
                        <li><strong>The Dignity Log:</strong> A private, encrypted journal to document your reality—the wins the system ignores, and the struggles it creates.</li>
                        <li><strong>Somatic grounding:</strong> Techniques to physically release the tension of holding space for 40 children.</li>
                    </ul>
                </ExpandableContent>

                <!-- Classroom -->
                <ExpandableContent title="Classroom (Pillar II)" subtitle="The Sacred Workspace" icon="🏫">
                    <p class="text-xl font-serif text-[#D4A574] mb-4">"Order is the foundation of peace."</p>
                    <p>The classroom is your domain, but administrative chaos often invades it. This pillar constructs a digital perimeter around your teaching, automating the trivial so you can focus on the profound.</p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4 text-[#2D3561]/70">
                        <li><strong>Automated Lesson Planning:</strong> Smart templates that respect national standards but free your creativity.</li>
                        <li><strong>Holistic Student Views:</strong> Seeing a child not as an index number, but as a trajectory of growth, struggle, and potential.</li>
                        <li><strong>Offline-First Architecture:</strong> Because your capacity to teach should never depend on a signal bar.</li>
                    </ul>
                </ExpandableContent>

                <!-- Community -->
                <ExpandableContent title="Community (Pillar III)" subtitle="The Sangha" icon="🌸">
                     <p class="text-xl font-serif text-[#D4A574] mb-4">"We heal in community."</p>
                     <p>Teaching is often a solitary act performed in a crowded room. The Sangha breaks this isolation. It is a horizontal network of trust, free from the vertical judgment of administration.</p>
                     <p>Here, vulnerability is strength. We share resources not to compete, but to elevate the collective baseline of the nation's education.</p>
                </ExpandableContent>

                <!-- Library -->
                <ExpandableContent title="Library (Pillar IV)" subtitle="The Epistemic Core" icon="📚">
                    <p class="text-xl font-serif text-[#D4A574] mb-4">"Theory is the roadmap to practice."</p>
                    <p>Access to the world’s most transformative educational thought—Dewey, Montessori, Freire—decolonized and translated. We bridge the gap between academic theory and the daily reality of a Sri Lankan classroom.</p>
                </ExpandableContent>

                <!-- Profile -->
                <ExpandableContent title="Profile (Pillar V)" subtitle="Identity & Sovereignty" icon="👤">
                    <p class="text-xl font-serif text-[#D4A574] mb-4">"You are more than your service number."</p>
                    <p>Your journey, your credentials, your impact—owned by you. A sovereign professional identity that transcends any single school or transfer. This is your career portfolio, immune to erasure.</p>
                </ExpandableContent>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TEANING Integration -->
    <section class="relative z-10 py-24 bg-[#E8E4D9]/30">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2D3561] to-[#1e2330] rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-16 border border-[#D4A574]/20 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-[#D4A574]/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

                <div class="relative z-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                             <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#D4A574]/20 border border-[#D4A574]/40 rounded text-xs font-bold text-[#D4A574] uppercase tracking-widest">Core Philosophy</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-5xl text-[#F5F1E8] mb-6">The Art of Teaning</h3>
                        <p class="font-sans text-lg text-[#F5F1E8]/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Education is not a transaction; it is a resonance. "Teaning" captures the impedance-matched circuit where teaching and learning dissolve into a single flow of becoming.
                        </p>
                        <p class="font-sans text-lg text-[#F5F1E8]/80 leading-relaxed">
                            Gurudevi is the first platform structurally designed to optimize this flow—removing the noise of administration so the signal of connection can come through.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-center">
                        <div class="p-8 border border-white/10 rounded-full bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm aspect-square flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center animate-pulse-slow">
                             <span class="text-6xl mb-4">⚡</span>
                             <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#D4A574]">Energy</span>
                             <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#D4A574]">Flow</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Waitlist / Call to Action: Split into Store and Email sections -->
    <section class="relative z-10 py-24 flex flex-col items-center text-center px-6 bg-[#2D3561]/5">
        <div class="max-w-4xl w-full space-y-24">
            
            <!-- Part 1: Download from Stores -->
            <div class="space-y-12">
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-4xl text-[#2D3561]">Available for Sanctuary</h3>
                    <p class="font-sans text-[#2D3561]/60">Download the Gurudevi portal directly to your device.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6">
                    <!-- Apple App Store Realistic Button -->
                    <button class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#0a0a0a] hover:bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all duration-300 w-[200px] h-[64px] group">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-8">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" class="w-7 h-7 fill-white group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><path d="M318.7 268.7c-.2-36.7 16.4-64.4 50-84.8-18.8-26.9-47.2-41.7-84.7-44.6-35.5-2.8-74.3 20.7-88.5 20.7-15 0-49.4-19.7-76.4-19.7C63.3 141.2 4 184.8 4 273.5q0 39.3 14.4 81.2c12.8 36.7 59 126.7 107.2 125.2 25.2-.6 43-17.9 75.8-17.9 31.8 0 48.3 17.9 76.4 17.9 48.6-.7 90.4-82.5 102.6-119.3-65.2-30.7-61.7-90-61.7-91.9zm-56.6-164.2c27.3-32.4 24.8-61.9 24-72.5-24.1 1.4-52 16.4-67.9 34.9-17.5 19.8-27.8 44.3-25.6 71.9 26.1 2 52.3-11.4 69.5-34.3z"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center text-left h-full">
                            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-sans tracking-widest text-white/60 leading-tight">Download on the</span>
                            <span class="text-xl font-bold font-sans leading-tight -mt-0.5">App Store</span>
                        </div>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Google Play Store Realistic Button -->
                    <button class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#0a0a0a] hover:bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all duration-300 w-[200px] h-[64px] group">
                         <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-8">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="w-6 h-6 fill-white group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><path d="M325.3 234.3L104.6 13l280.8 161.2-60.1 60.1zM47 0C34 6.8 25.3 19.2 25.3 35.3v441.3c0 16.1 8.7 28.5 21.7 35.3l256.6-256L47 0zm425.2 225.6l-58.9-34.1-65.7 64.5 65.7 64.5 60.1-34.1c18-14.3 18-46.5-1.2-60.8zM104.6 499l280.8-161.2-60.1-60.1L104.6 499z"/></svg>
                         </div>
                         <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center text-left h-full">
                            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-sans tracking-widest text-white/60 leading-tight">GET IT ON</span>
                            <span class="text-xl font-bold font-sans leading-tight -mt-0.5">Google Play</span>
                        </div>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Divider -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-8 py-4">
                <div class="h-px bg-[#2D3561]/10 w-24"></div>
                <span class="font-serif italic text-lg text-[#2D3561]/40">or</span>
                <div class="h-px bg-[#2D3561]/10 w-24"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Part 2: Join the Founding Circle -->
            <div class="space-y-8">
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[#2D3561]">The Founding Circle</h3>
                    <p class="font-sans text-[#2D3561]/60 max-w-md mx-auto">Join our private waitlist to receive early access updates and founding member benefits.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="bg-white/40 border border-[#2D3561]/10 p-8 rounded-2xl max-w-md mx-auto w-full backdrop-blur-md">
                    <form class="space-y-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
                        <input 
                            type="email" 
                            placeholder="your@email.com" 
                            class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white/60 border border-[#2D3561]/20 rounded-lg text-[#2D3561] focus:border-[#D4A574] focus:outline-none transition-colors"
                        />
                        <button class="w-full py-4 bg-[#D4A574] hover:bg-[#C09568] text-[#2D3561] font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(212,165,116,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_4px_30px_rgba(212,165,116,0.4)] text-lg">
                            Request Early Access
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</Layout>
